                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "Every living <w>creature</w> on this earth deserves respect and good treatment."
                            }
                        },
                        {
                            "text": "In de diepe oceaan ontdekten de wetenschappers een vreemd en prachtig <w>schepsel</w>.",
                            "target_lang_translations": {
                                "en": "In the deep ocean, the scientists discovered a strange and beautiful <w>creature</w>."
